flowchart TD
  accTitle: How a run becomes a verdict
  accDescr: A trusted manifest selects repository-owned commands; QA Kit checks documentation, runs the selected commands and records passing, failing or unusable configuration outcomes.
  A["Trusted manifest"] --> B["Select repository and checks"]
  B --> C["Documentation and owned commands"]
  C --> D["JSON report and exit status"]
  D --> E["Pass, fail or unusable configuration"]
